<title>RUSSIA: Russia cuts effective dlr T-bill yield to 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Russia cuts effective dlr T-bill yield to 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia is cutting the effective dollar yield for non-resident investors in government securities to 16 percent from 19 percent, effective October 16, a senior central bank official said on Monday.</p>
</text>
